From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: soc: qcom: support the Piano PD mapper

Provide the service entries consumed by the Piano remote processors.

The port retains changes from these linux-piano commits:
piano: NT36532 THP touch bring-up (milestone-touch) (#11) (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)

Co-authored-by: bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>

Link: https://github.com/blu-sharky/linux-piano/commit/00b055cd9c1634371cd501530ba5c29de4ab91d4
Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/e8fcf33971263f28085dbc0dbe5039438bf76c13
---
 drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c b/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
index 64ca99d7fad92075aa0060acc9375478045c7d42..26882be4ab2d58e9b12ffc37f11f14f6ed6e7d7c 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/qcom/qcom_pd_mapper.c
@@ -665,6 +665,16 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_pdm_domains[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,sm8750", .data = sm8550_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1e80100", .data = x1e80100_domains, },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,x1p42100", .data = x1e80100_domains, },
+	/*
+	 * piano: the stock sun/sunp device tree keeps Xiaomi's marketing
+	 * codename as the machine compatible, so the upstream sm8750 entry
+	 * never matches and pd-mapper fails with -ENODEV ("no support for
+	 * the platform").  Without it the ADSP charger protection domain is
+	 * never served, pmic-glink never reaches SERVREG up, and the
+	 * battery reads time out forever.
+	 */
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sun", .data = sm8550_domains, },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,sunp", .data = sm8550_domains, },
 	{},
 };
 
